{"id":"a6","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":10,"of":19,"title":"There is, there isn't","titleHe":"יֵשׁ וְאֵין","goal":"Say what exists and what doesn't.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"יֵשׁ means there is or there are — one word for both, since it doesn't change for number. Its opposite is אֵין."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"יֵשׁ סֵפֶר עַל הַשֻּׁלְחָן.","en":"There is a book on the table."},{"he":"יֵשׁ אֲנָשִׁים בַּבַּיִת.","en":"There are people in the house."},{"he":"אֵין קָפֶה.","en":"There's no coffee."},{"he":"אֵין מַיִם בַּבַּקְבּוּק.","en":"There's no water in the bottle."}]},{"type":"tip","body":"אֵין also does the work of isn't in a nominal sentence: הוּא אֵינוֹ מוֹרֶה, he is not a teacher — though in speech people simply say הוּא לֹא מוֹרֶה."}],"vocab":[{"he":"יֵשׁ","en":"there is, there are","translit":"yesh"},{"he":"אֵין","en":"there isn't","translit":"ein"},{"he":"עַל","en":"on","translit":"al"},{"he":"כָּאן","en":"here","translit":"kan"},{"he":"שָׁם","en":"there","translit":"sham"},{"he":"הַרְבֵּה","en":"a lot, many","translit":"harbe"},{"he":"קְצָת","en":"a little","translit":"ktsat"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["tired","there is, there are","hides","gave up on"],"correct":1,"prompt":"יֵשׁ","translit":"yesh"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["in my opinion","sits","there isn't","knife"],"correct":2,"prompt":"אֵין","translit":"ein"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["hard, difficult","meat","on","meal"],"correct":2,"prompt":"עַל","translit":"al"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["here","forever, ever","state, country","orange"],"correct":0,"prompt":"כָּאן","translit":"kan"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["there","sentence","his hand","answers"],"correct":0,"prompt":"שָׁם","translit":"sham"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["a lot, many","nothing","correct","was (f.)"],"correct":0,"prompt":"הַרְבֵּה","translit":"harbe"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["exile","saying (introduces speech)","darkness","a little"],"correct":3,"prompt":"קְצָת","translit":"ktsat"},{"type":"read","he":"אֵין","translit":"ein","en":"there isn't"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “here”?","options":["חַלּוֹן","שׂוֹנֵא","כָּאן","בַּיְשָׁן"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"אֵין מַיִם ___.","en":"There's no water in the bottle.","options":["יֵשׁ","הַרְבֵּה","אֵין","בַּבַּקְבּוּק"],"correct":3,"full":"אֵין מַיִם בַּבַּקְבּוּק."},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אֵין","הַרְבֵּה","שָׁם","כָּאן"],"correct":3,"say":"כָּאן","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “a lot, many”?","options":["וְכוּלֵּי","מוֹנִית","הַרְבֵּה","בְּרָכָה"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “there is, there are”?","options":["לָבוֹא","יֵשׁ","מוֹרָה","עַל"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["שָׁם","יֵשׁ","קְצָת","עַל"],"correct":0,"say":"שָׁם","he":true},{"type":"match","pairs":[["יֵשׁ","there is, there are"],["אֵין","there isn't"],["עַל","on"],["כָּאן","here"],["שָׁם","there"]]},{"type":"type","q":"Write “here” in Hebrew","answer":"כָּאן","hint":"kan"}]}